{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:32 2026-09-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:32 2026-09-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:32 2026-09-23 HKT</p><p>天水圍發生涉及校巴的車禍，多人受傷。今日（23日）早上7時32分，一輛載有學童的學校小巴駛至天瑞路71至77號對開時，與一輛的士相撞。救援人員趕到，校巴上有8名學童受傷，幸全部傷勢輕微，獲送院治理。意外原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"校巴與的士相撞，釀成8名學童受傷。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dca525106253090955b4736af0d5df8c/2026-09/3_3_21.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d02dcf88b6b906757c55942c933db56e/2026-09/2_28.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5eb553ddd83c60d63cf84c6c6a9ed92f/2026-09/5_6.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"校巴司機協助警方調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c091b3ea775c9d61d2d786ac7d087776/2026-09/7_2_0.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/93cad188199fbd8ba9a0aa69c0ce9e44/2026-09/4_1_2.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b47800158c05eb3c9f2bfb7ed7918d07/2026-09/1_3_1.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T02:39:51.790549+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}